	<h3><u>zainab ko ghazi yaad aaya</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">haay zainab haay haay shaam</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">jhoon jhoon baazaar qarib aaya<br />
zainab ko ghazi yaad aaaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">haathon se ya phir baalon se tchehre ko tchhupaale shehzaadi<br />
ye shaam shaher ki galiyaan hain dil thaamle ay aaqa zaadi<br />
fizza ne jab ye batlaaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">maahol sharaabi jab dekha baba ki vasiyat yaad aayi<br />
koyi to mujhe tchaadar laade hothon pe yehi fariyaad aayi<br />
jab koyi nahin tchaadar laaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">phir shaam ke logon ne badla ajdaad ka yun zainab se liya<br />
tchaadar tchhini patthar maare or garm kabhi paani phaika<br />
durra jo sakina ne khaaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">abbas kahaan hai ay zainab jab shimr hiqaarat se bola<br />
gash khaane lage sab ehle haram kulsum pukaari wa waila<br />
sajjad ko yasrab yaad aaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">khaamosh rahi aulaade nabi karbal se yahaan tak zulm saha<br />
khuli ye manaadi karne laga ye kunba hai ek baaghi ka<br />
mazlum jo baghi kehlaaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">har gaam naya ek zulm huwa laatchaar musaafir zainab par<br />
zainab ko rulaaya zaalim ne naaqon ke qarib neza laa kar<br />
shabbir ka sar jo dikhlaaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">farhan qayaamat ka gham hai mazhar ne likha hai kya nauha<br />
shabbir bina abbas bina ye pehla safar tha zainab ka<br />
jhoon jhoon baazaar qarib aaya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">zainab ko ghazi yaad aaaya</p>
</p>
